    .Program asks the user to enter scores separated by spaces.
    .Converts the input into a list of integers.
    .Calculates the mean by summing all scores and dividing by the count.
    .Sorts the list to help find the median.
    .Determines the median depending on whether the count is odd    or even.
    .Finds the mode by counting occurrences of each score without using libraries.
    .Displays the calculated mean, median, and mode to the user.
    .Works without importing any external libraries.